<Base
  title="Has AI token usage plateaued? No. Spending has. · vikrantsingh.fyi"
  description="A team burned through its coding budget in weeks. The model was cheaper. The agents were longer. Online, people pointed at a falling chart and said demand had peaked. The chart was a price index."
